# CPython 3.12 bridge test runner and the Android common pip set (pythainlp and
# tzdata as upstream wheels; app/wheels/common ships pythainlp repacked). The
# Vietnamese and Cantonese engines are the upstream wheels too; their models
# live inside them here, while the APK ships them stripped and downloads the
# models. underthesea's declared requirements (Click, PyYAML, huggingface-hub)
# are resolved into the lock only so pip check passes: the APK never ships them.
